==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Literally “for what”, from {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|за||for}} + {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|што̏||what}}. For the conjunction compare {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|зато што}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/zâʃto/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|за|што|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=за̏што}}

# [[why]], [[what for]]
#: зашто не? — why not?
#: зашто то? — why so? why is that?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|why}} {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|што̏}}

